3f8ffc-29de-4c60-bdf1-b8c15b563052","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"NAT のソース変換あやしい可能性","ts":"1617463533.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qvM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03dda4e9-7de4-44da-8801-3a07ef72b2db","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"gerbera は直です。Serviio も今は直で試してます","ts":"1617463521.019900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xwpf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cdb77e95-f26a-4a4f-ab10-f3b63f978c12","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"どっちも docker なんです？","ts":"1617463494.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1/e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"260b9f3a-8c06-4c54-afa8-6b5c9e6044b7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なぜか時間差があったけどとにかく増えた","ts":"1617463430.018900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hCs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40061f9d-3b66-43b6-a675-4476e04a28ca","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"お、いいはなし","ts":"1617463421.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xk2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c48a0e1-0513-4a40-84c8-1de92cc12bad","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、嘘だ。今見たら `ip maddr show` にアドレス増えてました","ts":"1617463410.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZT8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab4d9eb4-f580-4d86-a138-a7c041781f49","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"gerbera を起動したところ、 `ip maddr show` には変化なし。しかし VLC のサービス一覧に gerbera が表示される","ts":"1617463393.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OqHL7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e15bc60c-6db6-4197-af28-06469d58283d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど。gerbera 起動してみるか","ts":"1617463295.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pfky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"addef733-43c1-40c9-86d5-a382667d7135","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あとさっき挙げた記事の C コードをビルドして実行してみる、とか","ts":"1617463222.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3bde15dc-66c8-4f90-b8ee-ccf355a88b2e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、あとは他の実装も使えるのなら、試しに起動してみて登録されるかを見るのもよいかもですね","ts":"1617463147.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5gF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ffd70c3-8836-4d2d-b507-948daa5617be","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ものは試しなのでやるだけやってみるか","ts":"1617463047.015200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y+7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5633f278-c800-4a60-b86d-a803b41d3296","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あーありそう...?\nいやーでも port は 1900 だって話だしなぁ...","ts":"1617463042.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0c8I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2953b56d-054a-40a6-94bc-1caa3bc064cc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"root 権限がいるってことはない…ですよね?","ts":"1617462965.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nDeTZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdf029f3-f113-4d34-9b37-4072ccc0e563","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ぐぬぅ","ts":"1617462958.014100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uIkgu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6e185d2-91fc-4784-bc7b-0ab181256895","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Docker やめてホストに直で置いてるサーバを起動してみましたが…inet は増えず","ts":"1617462947.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FdtV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c159711-919f-4e5c-9c0b-551c33a3ab31","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"です","ts":"1617462807.013100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R1K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a572c514-1ea7-473b-bc6d-4dfb8dc21f74","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ああ、NAT ではなく、か","ts":"1617462794.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZCSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82844116-7e75-4dc2-8e21-74d0cd7e1811","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いや、それはいい気がします","ts":"1617462782.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ejxx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e66af67-3f97-438b-8000-a0ed42430266","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"0.0.0.0 がまずい…?","ts":"1617462759.012200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6Vvm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6c81259-a24f-45c5-bd5f-99380edca97d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"docker ならって話はーありえなくはないですが...\nhost network 使わないとだめ、とかはあるかも...","ts":"1617462736.012000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BJn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a335b0b-20dd-405c-878c-b7e4b9b6a599","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ですです\nそのサーバが中で `setsockopt` システムコールを呼んでるはず、という理解です","ts":"1617462691.011200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NvwtP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dd93d15-a909-44a3-b33e-23f041abf7fe","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一応 Serviio を Docker で動かして運用しているというブログは見かけたので(というかこの Dockerfile 自体拾い物なので)動く気はする","ts":"1617462676.010800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"41L6m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cffb206b-1f5d-4a27-91c4-16a5488ead56","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Docker だとダメってことは…ないですよね","ts":"1617462631.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"df7I+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0a73802-9ff0-4663-9070-287f68ca4f47","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、なるほど。プロセスが起動することにより追加される感じなんですね","ts":"1617462602.009100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXz58"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47fd8deb-173b-49a6-8893-548a422009f8","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"です、というか正しく起動していたらそれが追加されているはず、という認識でいます","ts":"1617462556.008000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6aB6n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf0145a-90a5-47de-8398-e48fbc79764b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`ip maddr show` に `inet 239.255.255.250` が追加できればよさそう、というのは変わってないです?","ts":"1617462524.007300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"axs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"076eb625-6e5f-4b6f-90e8-35ef47e611e9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"と言うか route の設定が今 LISTEN しているかどうかでできたりできなかったりするってことはなさそうな?","ts":"1617462492.006400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b001f8c-3f82-4159-ae58-ef46ff927b34","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ふむぅ...","ts":"1617462448.005800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x64oY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5328f2bd-36b9-430f-bc77-c5b716e6dd75","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Docker とホスト直起動と両方試してますが…今は Docker 